      "ks_gerstner_wave": {
        "comments": [
          {
            "color": "#60a5fa",
            "id": "note_body",
            "position": {
              "x": 322,
              "y": 34
            },
            "size": {
              "h": 56,
              "w": 2990
            },
            "text": "**Gerstner wave** — `k = 2π/λ`, phase speed `c = √(g/k)`, `f = k(d·p − c·t)`, amplitude `a = s/k`.\nOffset = `(dx·a·cos f, a·sin f, dz·a·cos f)` — vertices travel in circles, so crests sharpen. Normal delta = `(−dx·s·cos f, −s·sin f, −dz·s·cos f)`."
          }
        ],
